{%- assign sk_portal_url = 'https://siraatskitchen.com/a/loop_subscriptions/customer' -%}{%- comment -%} subscription portal: Loop (LOG 30 Oct) or Recharge customer portal link. One click, no login if possible. {%- endcomment -%}
